        "body": "Hesai Group, which does business as Hesai Technology, describes itself as a global leader in 3D perception and lidar solutions for ADAS and autonomous mobility. The company says its lidar sensors support advanced driver assistance systems, autonomous vehicles, trucking, robotics, and industrial applications, and that it supplies customers in over 40 countries. Its site states that lidars enable features such as AEB (Automated Emergency Braking), NOA (Navigation on Autopilot), and L4+ autonomous driving for robotaxis and robobuses.\n\nThe company is a public company trading under the ticker HSAI, with headquarters in Shanghai. Its SEC CIK is 0001861737.",
